  "cited_article_id": "configure-automated-reminders",
  "reply": "Please verify that each patient has a verified mobile number or email and that communication opt‑in is enabled in their profile. Then review the delivery status in **Reports > Message Log**; if you see a 'Failed' status due to carrier blocking, confirm the phone number supports SMS. Remember reminders are not sent for appointments marked 'Cancelled' or 'Arrived' and SMS messages are limited to 160 characters. If failures persist, provide the affected patient IDs and timestamps so we can investigate further."
}
